      "text": "Packing efficiency of unit cell of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo></math> Packing efficiency of unit cell of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#62;</mo></math> Packing efficiency of unit cell of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math>",
