  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Metal <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> forms FCC (edge length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math> )</p><p>Metal y forms BCC (edge length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub></math> )</p><p>Metal <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math> forms SC (edge length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub></math> )</p><p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math></p><p>Packing efficiency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>FCC</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>BCC</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>SC</mi></math></p><p>Packing efficiency unit cell <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math></p><p>In FCC unit cell:- atoms along the face diagonals are in contact.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math></p><p>In BCC unit cell: atoms along the body diagonal are</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math></p><p>In SC unit cell, atoms along the edge are in contact</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math></p><p>Density of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;(Number of atoms of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> per unit cell <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>zM</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mrow><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Density of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> : (Number of atoms of y per unit cell <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>zM</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mrow><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>108</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>32768</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Density of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo></math> density of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math>.</p>"
  }
